{"name":"Caribou","hex":"#816c5e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Caribou","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A rural area of Pictou County, Nova Scotia, Canada.","A census-designated place in Plumas County, California, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Caribou"}],"entries":[{"title":"Caribou (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Caribou is the eighth studio album by British musician Elton John, released on 24 June 1974 by MCA Records in the US and on 28 June by DJM Records in the UK. It was his fourth chart-topping album in the United States and his third in the United Kingdom. The album contains the singles \"Don't Let the Sun Go Down on Me\", which reached number 16 on the UK Singles Chart and number two in the US, and \"The Bitch Is Back\", which reached number 15 in the UK and number four in the US. Both singles reached number one in Canada on the RPM 100 national Top Singles Chart, as did the album itself."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/54/Elton_John_-_Caribou.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caribou_(album)","wikidata":"Q1754363"},{"title":"Reindeer","blocks":[{"text":"The reindeer or caribou is a species of deer with circumpolar distribution, native to Arctic, subarctic, tundra, boreal, and mountainous regions of Northern Europe, Siberia, and North America. It is the only representative of the genus Rangifer. More recent studies suggest the splitting of reindeer and caribou. \"All caribou and reindeer throughout the world are considered to be the same species, but there are 7 subspecies.\""}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Reinbukken_p%C3%A5_frisk_gr%C3%B8nt_beite._-_panoramio.jpg/330px-Reinbukken_p%C3%A5_frisk_gr%C3%B8nt_beite._-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reindeer","wikidata":"Q39624"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg/500px-Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg/1280px-Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg/500px-Barren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABarren_ground_caribou_grazing_with_autumn_foliage_in_background.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Caribou.jpg/500px-Caribou.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Caribou.jpg/1280px-Caribou.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Caribou.jpg/500px-Caribou.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaribou.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/1999Mt-Caribou002_crop-AI.jpg/500px-1999Mt-Caribou002_crop-AI.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/1999Mt-Caribou002_crop-AI.jpg/1280px-1999Mt-Caribou002_crop-AI.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedi